     "<table border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" bgcolor=\"#ffffff\" style=\"max-width:1024px;text-align:left;min-width:320px;width:505px;margin:0px auto\"><tbody><tr><td><table border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" height=\"8\">\r\n\r\n<tbody><tr><td></td></tr></tbody></table><table border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" style=\"color:rgb(0,136,204);margin:0px;font-size:1.6em;background-color:rgb(239,239,239);padding:0px;border-bottom-width:1px;border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-color:rgb(221,221,221);width:505px\">\r\n\r\n<tbody><tr><td><h2 style=\"padding:0px;margin:5px 20px;font-size:16px;line-height:1;font-weight:normal;color:rgb(70,70,70);font-family:&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\">rugbcn (<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">rug...@gmail.com</a>) shared a post from rugbcn</h2>\r\n\r\n</td><td style=\"text-align:right\"><img border=\"0\" alt=\"\" style=\"margin:5px 20px 5px 0px;vertical-align:middle\"></td></tr></tbody></table><table border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"20\" bgcolor=\"#ffffff\" style=\"width:505px\">\r\n\r\n<tbody><tr><td><table border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" style=\"width:465px\"><tbody><tr><td valign=\"top\"><table border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" style=\"width:465px\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"width:60px!important;white-space:nowrap;vertical-align:top\">\r\n\r\n<a href=\"http://rugbcn.wordpress.com/author/lluisramon84/\" style=\"display:block;margin-right:10px;color:rgb(37,133,178)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://rugbcn.wordpress.com/author/lluisramon84/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793242916461000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2SHbC3ZwrzId0prEL43fqn\"><img border=\"0\" alt=\"\" height=\"50\" width=\"50\"></a></td><td><h2 style=\"margin:0px;color:rgb(85,85,85);font-size:20px\">\r\n\r\n<a href=\"http://rugbcn.wordpress.com/2012/07/09/curs-gratuit-diniciacio-a-r-segona-sessio-actualitzacio/\" style=\"text-decoration:none!important;color:rgb(37,133,178)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://rugbcn.wordpress.com/2012/07/09/curs-gratuit-diniciacio-a-r-segona-sessio-actualitzacio/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793242916461000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1LQUVKPUyxLDmRJgTc_NLm\">Curs gratuït d’iniciació a R ( segona sessió) [Actualització]</a></h2>\r\n\r\n<span style=\"color:rgb(136,136,136)\">by <a href=\"http://rugbcn.wordpress.com/author/lluisramon84/\" style=\"color:rgb(136,136,136)!important\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://rugbcn.wordpress.com/author/lluisramon84/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793242916461000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2SHbC3ZwrzId0prEL43fqn\">Lluís Ramon</a></span></td></tr></tbody></table><div style=\"margin-top:1em;max-width:560px\">\r\n\r\n<p style=\"font-size:14px;line-height:1.4em;color:rgb(68,68,68);font-family:&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;margin:0px 0px 1em\">Aquesta entrada és només per recordar que aquests dimecres tenim la segona sessió d&#39;introducció a l&#39;R. Aprofito per aclarir algunes coses que havien quedat pendents i que ara ja les tenim definides. Com sempre, si sabeu d&#39;alguna persona que pugui estar interessada en endinsar-se en el mon de l&#39;R o que vulgui veure de que va, [...]</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"font-size:14px;line-height:1.4em;color:rgb(68,68,68);font-family:&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;margin:0px 0px 1em\"><a href=\"http://rugbcn.wordpress.com/2012/07/09/curs-gratuit-diniciacio-a-r-segona-sessio-actualitzacio/\" style=\"color:rgb(37,133,178)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://rugbcn.wordpress.com/2012/07/09/curs-gratuit-diniciacio-a-r-segona-sessio-actualitzacio/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793242916461000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1LQUVKPUyxLDmRJgTc_NLm\">Read more of this post</a></p>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"clear:both\"></div></div><div style=\"color:rgb(153,153,153);font-size:0.9em;margin-top:4px;line-height:19px;padding:15px 0px;border-top-width:1px;border-top-style:solid;border-top-color:rgb(238,238,238);border-bottom-width:1px;border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-color:rgb(238,238,238);overflow:hidden\">\r\n\r\n<strong><a href=\"http://rugbcn.wordpress.com/author/lluisramon84/\" style=\"color:rgb(37,133,178)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://rugbcn.wordpress.com/author/lluisramon84/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793242916461000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2SHbC3ZwrzId0prEL43fqn\">Lluís Ramon</a></strong> | July 9, 2012 at 9:19 pm | Categories: <a href=\"http://rugbcn.wordpress.com/category/meetings/\" style=\"color:rgb(37,133,178)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://rugbcn.wordpress.com/category/meetings/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793242916461000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1HnW_rmLkjEMIongvOtZ3d\">Meetings</a> | URL: <a href=\"http://wp.me/p1KCUp-bK\" style=\"color:rgb(37,133,178)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://wp.me/p1KCUp-bK&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793242916461000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2-8samBGC8jgjqVfgIF_RG\">http://wp.me/p1KCUp-bK</a></div>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"font-size:14px;padding:1em 0px 0em;color:rgb(102,102,102);margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px\"></p><table border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" style=\"width:465px\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"width:10px\"><a href=\"http://rugbcn.wordpress.com/2012/07/09/curs-gratuit-diniciacio-a-r-segona-sessio-actualitzacio/#respond\" style=\"border-top-left-radius:10em;border-top-right-radius:10em;border-bottom-right-radius:10em;border-bottom-left-radius:10em;border:1px solid rgb(17,114,158);text-decoration:none;color:rgb(255,255,255);background-color:rgb(37,133,178);padding:5px 15px;font-size